<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SKODA SETS CZK 600 PREMIUM OM ISSUE.</title>
<headline>CZECH SKODA SETS CZK 600 PREMIUM OM ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech engineering concern Skoda a.s. said on Friday it would set the issue price of its share issue of up to 2.5 billion crowns at 1,600 crowns per share, implying a 600 crown premium over nominal value in the first round of the offering.</p>
<p>Skoda shares, traded on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange, rose five crowns on Friday to close at 980.</p>
</text>
